Dialogue: 2,0:11:21.15,0:11:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}好漂亮啊
Dialogue: 2,0:11:37.28,0:11:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}把腿抬高点吧
Dialogue: 2,0:11:41.35,0:11:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}这样吗？嗯
